 html←data EditGroupHomepage_ groupName;html;parms;markdown;email;msg
⍝ Returns the form for creating or editing the home page of a group.
⍝ `data` is (markdown email msg): what is there already, and a message to show, if any, like why
⍝ the last attempt to save was refused.
⍝ The names of the fields are what `SaveGroupHompeage` expects, so they must not change.
 (markdown email msg)←data
 html←(⍬('Group ',groupName)'/groups')HtmlHeader''
 html,←⊂'<div class="page-head">'
 html,←⊂GetBreadcrumb('Groups'(Reg.VersionOf_REST,'/groups'))(groupName('/',GetVersion_REST'group-homepage?name=',groupName))('Edit' '')
 html,←⊂'<h2>',(EscapeSpecialChars groupName),' <span class="page-sub">editing the home page</span></h2>'
 html,←⊂'</div>'
 :If 0<≢msg
     html,←⊂'<p class="form-message noprint">',msg,'</p>'
 :EndIf
 html,←⊂'<form id="create-group-homepage" class="group-home-form" action="','group-homepage-save">'

 html,←⊂'<div class="field">'
 html,←⊂'content'H.Label'Content'
 html,←⊂'<span class="field-hint"><a href="https://download.aplteam.com/MarkAPL_CheatSheet.html" title="Link to the Markdown Cheat Sheet" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Markdown</a> without HTML</span>'
 html,←⊂'<textarea name="content" id="content" rows="15" placeholder="your markdown" autofocus required spellcheck="true" lang="en">'
 html,←⊆EscapeSpecialChars markdown
 html,←⊂'</textarea>'
 html,←⊂'</div>'

 html,←⊂'<div class="field-row">'
 html,←⊂'<div class="field">'
 html,←⊂'email'H.Label'Email address'
 parms←⎕NS''
 parms.(id name type placeholder value)←'email' 'email' 'email' 'your.name@email.address'email
 html,←⊂'required'H.Input parms
 html,←⊂'</div>'
 :If 0<≢G.Credentials
     html,←⊂'<div class="field">'
     html,←⊂'api-key'H.Label'API key'
     parms←⎕NS''
     parms.(id name type placeholder)←'api-key' 'api-key' 'password' 'Password (API-key)'
     html,←⊂'required'H.Input parms
     html,←⊂'</div>'
 :EndIf
 html,←⊂'</div>'

 parms←⎕NS''
 parms.(id name type value style readonly)←'group' 'group' 'text'groupName'display:none;' 'readonly'
 html,←⊂H.Input parms

 ⍝ This is used to tell the server what this is all about. That allows the server to determine that
 ⍝ the content must be massaged in a specific way.
 parms←⎕NS''
 parms.(id name type value style readonly)←'sgh' 'sgh' 'text' 'save-group-homepage' 'display:none;' 'readonly'
 html,←⊂H.Input parms

 html,←⊂'<div class="form-actions">'
 html,←⊂'<input id="submit-homepage" formmethod="post" class="button" value="Save" type="submit">'
 html,←⊂'<a href="/',(GetVersion_REST'group-homepage?name='),(EscapeAttributeValue groupName),'">Back to the home page</a>'
 html,←⊂'</div>'

 html,←⊂'</form>'

 html,←⊆GetFooter
 html,←⊂'</body>'
 html,←⊂'</html>'
⍝Done
